<h1>atrium</h1>
<span class="sub">the first chamber of the hollow house</span>
<span class="glyph l">✹ &nbsp; ✷ &nbsp; ✮</span>
<svg class="eye" width="220" height="120" viewBox="0 0 220 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g fill="none" stroke="#1a282a" stroke-width="1">
      <path d="M5,60 Q110,5 215,60 Q110,115 5,60 Z"/>
